// Cloudflare: the site as static assets, with no Worker code at all.
//
// Moved here from Vercel on 2026-10-15 after the project was paused twice for
// running out of function processor time. Nothing a visitor uses runs on a
// server, and static requests here are not metered against any allowance.
//
// html_handling "none" is the setting that matters. The default strips .html
// and redirects /guides.html to /guides, and every canonical link, og:url and
// sitemap entry on this site names the .html address - a canonical that
// redirects is the one thing a canonical must not do.
//
// _headers (the Content-Security-Policy) and _redirects in apps/web are read
// from the assets directory as they are.
{
  "name": "muletto",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./apps/web",
    "html_handling": "none",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page"
  }
}
